{"aliases": ["雛見沢村民集会in白川郷", "Hinamizawa Village Assembly in Shirakawa-gou"], "dates": "2025.06.22", "circles": [{"aliases": ["07th Expansion"], "position": "騎士", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/0001.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://07th-expansion.net/", "https://x.com/07th_official"]}, {"aliases": ["REMOLABO"], "position": "騎士", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/0002.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://remotaro8.wixsite.com/remotaro", "https://x.com/remotaro"]}, {"aliases": ["Pomexgranate. & M.Graveyard"], "position": "騎士", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/0000.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://xakiksakita.wixsite.com/mxgranate"]}, {"aliases": ["STRIKE HOLE"], "pen_names": ["花羅"], "position": "風01", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3005.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://strikehole.blog.jp/", "https://x.com/hanara_striker"], "description": "\"今では考えられないことですが、かつて「ひぐらしのなく頃に」は、聖地・白川郷から忌み嫌われていた！ それがなぜ、今聖地で即売会を開催できるぐらいには村から歓迎されるようになったのか…？ アニメ聖地の町おこしを研究する筆者が、10年以上のフィールドワーク（というか聖地巡礼）を経て、その過程を明らかにします！\""}, {"aliases": ["07th MASQUERADE運営委員会"], "pen_names": ["宮田伊織"], "position": "風02", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3089.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/07thonly"], "description": "07th MASQUERADEは2025年10月4日（土）日本橋浜町のプラザマームにて開催予定です！何卒よろしくお願いいたします。"}, {"aliases": ["さくたろレコード"], "pen_names": ["motton"], "position": "風03", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3003.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/motton106"], "description": "\"07th作品の二次創作イメージソング制作を行っています。 今回向けの新譜ひぐらし偽曲 Miracle Coin2を頒布！\""}, {"aliases": ["三度の飯よりレナが好き"], "pen_names": ["レ鉈リアン"], "position": "風04", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3094.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/Lenatalion2"]}, {"aliases": ["古手大神宮"], "pen_names": ["高橋御山人"], "position": "風05", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3010.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://www.jyashin.net/", "https://x.com/gosanjin_euau "], "description": "\"羽入さんぬい旅行写真集「はにゅ旅」、第三巻を刊行予定！！ 今回は白川郷に特化した内容を予定しています。 既刊の「はにゅ旅」も頒布します！！ \""}, {"aliases": ["塩味印"], "pen_names": ["塩味"], "position": "風06", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3026.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/Shiomi00"], "description": "聖地白川郷での村民集会〜！嬉しいです〜！新刊や可愛いグッズを作って持っていけるようがんばります！"}, {"aliases": ["ぴぐの森"], "pen_names": ["森田ぴぐ"], "position": "風07", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3095.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://mrpg.booth.pm/", "https://x.com/mrpg_0824"], "description": "ひぐらし関連のコスプレや絵の創作物を頒布します。"}, {"aliases": ["青春18金魚"], "pen_names": ["クラ"], "position": "風08", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3013.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://www.18kingyo.com/", "https://x.com/kura_kingyo"], "description": "\"実写ドラマを制作してます。 主に白川村で「ひぐらしのなく頃に」の実写ドラマを撮ってます。 2025年、今年で19年目に突入。\""}, {"aliases": ["白黒茶会"], "pen_names": ["柊りん"], "position": "林01", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3075.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://rinlaurant.booth.pm/", "https://www.pixiv.net/users/1291505", "https://x.com/RinLaurant"], "description": "\"ひぐらし・うみねこメインの既存グッズと、 過去絵を使用した新規グッズと出します。 間に合うなら描き下ろしのグッズも出ます！ 無配もありますー。\""}, {"aliases": ["からあげうどん"], "pen_names": ["serico."], "position": "林02", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3040.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://www.pixiv.net/users/201895", "https://x.com/serico_"], "description": "ゆるい4コマ漫画と日常使いできるグッズを頒布します。"}, {"aliases": ["情熱38度5分"], "pen_names": ["しのみえ ずも"], "position": "林03", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3027.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/shinomie_zumo"], "description": "\"うみねこ、ローガンメインの腐向けサークルです。 漫画、グッズメインの頒布予定。 令和に流行れローズガンズデイズ\""}, {"aliases": ["狼森のソラ"], "pen_names": ["狼森"], "position": "林04", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3038.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://www.pixiv.net/users/9529117", "https://x.com/oinomori_sora"]}, {"aliases": ["信頼の置けない料理店"], "pen_names": ["トラスト"], "position": "林05", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3115.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/trst0031"], "description": "\"屁理屈推理合戦形式の偽書を頒布いたします 小説としても、問題としてもお楽しみいただければ幸いです\""}, {"aliases": ["マンモス校購買部"], "pen_names": ["脱兎"], "position": "林06", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3035.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://poipiku.com/4440308/", "https://x.com/skif_dat"], "description": "\"考察系の新刊コピー本と、広瀬さんとの既刊合作氷室恵美(彼岸花の咲く夜に)漫画を頒布予定です！ オフイベでのサークル参加は初めてですが、お話だけでも訪問いただけたら嬉しいです！ よろしくお願いします～！\""}, {"aliases": ["いんぐりもんぐり科"], "pen_names": ["感染者もどき"], "position": "林07", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3011.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "description": "お初ながらよろしくお願い致します。"}, {"aliases": ["サンベアー"], "pen_names": ["ひぐま"], "position": "火01", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/2999.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/higu_ma3105"], "description": "\"白川郷での村民集会開催はやばすぎる👀👀👀👀 めっっちゃかぁいいグッズいっぱい用意します！！沙都子多めです🫡🫡🫡\""}, {"aliases": ["にやね屋"], "pen_names": ["にゃね"], "position": "火02", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3072.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/niyane"], "description": "ひぐらしイラスト本、手描きイラストの原画を頒布予定です！"}, {"aliases": ["きれいなおはぎ組"], "pen_names": ["L3"], "position": "火03", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3065.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/L3_LEVEL3"], "description": "\"サークル初参加です！ ひぐらしのグッズ持っていきます、よろしくお願いしますっ！\""}, {"aliases": ["いぐあなカレー。"], "pen_names": ["以下略"], "position": "火04", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3007.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/maika_82"]}, {"aliases": ["BlueKirk"], "pen_names": ["カーク"], "position": "火05", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3009.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://www.pixiv.net/users/532505", "https://x.com/kakutaro09"], "description": "\"ひぐらしのなく頃に 女こまし編のIFアフターストーリーの漫画です。 圭一全方位網でのラブコメです！ 今回はちゃんと圭一ちゃん答えだしますからね！\""}, {"aliases": ["脳汁デブリ"], "pen_names": ["愚者愚者"], "position": "火06", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3087.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://www.pixiv.net/users/44317357", "https://x.com/gushagusha5"], "description": "\"愚者愚者と申します。 『ひぐらしのなく頃に』の圭一や悟史の 女装中心のイラスト本を作る予定です。 レナ達も描きます。\""}, {"aliases": ["そけっと＆白瀬宗也"], "pen_names": ["白瀬宗也"], "position": "火07", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3014.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/sirase_souya"], "description": "\"そけっとさんと白瀬さんの合同サークルです。ひぐらしメインですが、うみねこも大好きです！ 今回はそけっとさんの白川郷グルメ本と新作のイラストアクスタ、白瀬のシャドーボックスや立体コラージュ、手作りのキーホルダーを持っていきます！せっかくの夢の現地開催なのでお祭り気分で楽しむ所存なので、ぜひ遊びに来てください〜！\""}, {"aliases": ["RED RIBBON REVENGER"], "pen_names": ["魔公子"], "position": "山01", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3001.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://portal.circle.ms/Circle/Index/10001812", "https://www.pixiv.net/users/284757", "https://x.com/makoushi"], "description": "\"聖地での開催おめでとうございます! 奇遇にも当サークルのさとりか本もちょうど10冊目となります! 精一杯頑張りますのでどうぞよろしくお願いいたします!\""}, {"aliases": ["あきすぺーす@荻町下ゴソ店"], "pen_names": ["安芸しょうや"], "position": "山02", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3019.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://www.pixiv.net/users/3765551", "https://x.com/pb19AJBKqFVHzrK"]}, {"aliases": ["★☆雲雀☆★"], "pen_names": ["裕貴美"], "position": "山03", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3030.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://www.pixiv.net/users/567985", "https://x.com/yukimi1019"], "description": "圭一受け、圭レナ、りかさと好き"}, {"aliases": ["コロコロ転がる"], "pen_names": ["海内圭"], "position": "山04", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3018.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://lit.link/umiuchihouse", "https://www.pixiv.net/users/57107515", "https://x.com/u_umiuchi"], "description": "じゃーんアクスタの再販もあります"}, {"aliases": ["salty"], "pen_names": ["塩舌"], "position": "山05", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3031.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/shiotan0917"], "description": "\"2022年の07th村民集会で初めてサークル参加し、今回は2度目の参加となります！ ひぐらしメンバー全員大好きですが、推しは詩音とレナなので、頒布物は2人が主になると思います！（うみねこも大好きです！） 画力が追いついていないところがありますが、愛は沢山込めて生み出したものなので、もし良かったら見に来て下さると、とても嬉しいです！ 当日はサークル参加の方も一般参加の方も体調に気を付けて、全力で楽しみましょー！！\""}, {"aliases": ["金米糖工房"], "pen_names": ["麻璃音"], "position": "山06", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3294.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/confeitokobo"], "description": "部活メンバーのイラスト本や、色紙をいろいろ描きたいよていです。"}, {"aliases": ["さとうのまえ"], "pen_names": ["翠月みりん"], "position": "山07", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3114.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/@mrk_8080"]}, {"aliases": ["無限大"], "pen_names": ["りさ∞"], "position": "山08", "media": [{"path": "shirakawa_circle_cuts/3008.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20250522215723/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/8th/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://x.com/uw8takkun0621"], "description": "\"ひぐらしのなく頃にサークルです。 新刊、グッズを予定しております。\""}], "sources": [{"source": "Date: https://web.archive.org/web/20250521174133/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}, {"source": "Participating circles: https://web.archive.org/web/20261025141548/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/cutlist/cutlist.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}, {"source": "Participating circles (alt): https://web.archive.org/web/20260214223311/https://mattari-an.net/shu-kai/list.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}], "